      "title": "小紅帽提著泡麵探望奶奶，卻在小木屋前遇見怪物。\n\n刺眼光線中，怪物面目猙獰，張開血盆大口撲來。\n\n小紅帽驚恐萬分，舉起泡麵奮力一擊，怪物慘叫後退。",
      "body": "<p>In the dazzling light, the monster's face was ferocious, and it opened its bloody mouth and rushed towards it.</p><p><br></p><p>Little Red Riding Hood was so frightened that she raised the instant noodles and struck hard. The monster screamed and retreated.</p>",
